    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1cebe808932fceb449b46a5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她指的应该是前些天，西沙里奥和迷人景致\n一起制作健康料理，招待了正在控制体重的\n特别周那件事吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2e3b537b4d029acf33f07cf1557cd44a2b3454d819597bfe4bcf37020ae3bbd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
